Bubble
======

Bubble is a fork of Herdr, a desktop app for terminals and coding agents.

Upstream project: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

Changes in this fork include the Bubble name and branding, a Bubble feature
port, Bubble settings, editor, AI, Git, preview, diagnostics, command palette
and open-link mods, additional themes, and removal of the upstream app update
and telemetry endpoints.

Bubble keeps the upstream terminal core (`herdr-core` / `hc`) as an external
runtime dependency. The core is not part of this repository and remains under
its own upstream license and project.

The original Herdr copyright and license notices are retained in LICENSE,
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES and the files they cover.

Bubble branding artwork was taken from the Bubble project
(https://github.com/nirmitpatel9714-hue/Bubble). That project is licensed
AGPL-3.0; the artwork is included here as the fork's branding with the project
owner's permission. Confirm the combined distribution license before
publishing binaries. See licenses/inventory.json and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.
